        "original_id": "01ada0f4-fced-5e2f-b2b8-c2f0f230cac7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bhupen Hazarika\n- Organizations: Sangeet Natak Akademi, Government of India\n- Awards: Padmashri, Sangeet Natak Akademi Award, Dada Saheb Phalke Award, Padmabhushan, Sangeet Natak Akademi Fellowship\n- Works: Daina (1984 film)\n- Topics: Performing arts, film music\n\nFacts:\n- In 1977, Bhupen Hazarika received the Padmashri.\n- In 1984, Bhupen Hazarika composed the music for the film Daina.\n- In 1987, Bhupen Hazarika received the Sangeet Natak Akademi Award.\n- In 1992, the Government of India awarded Bhupen Hazarika the Dada Saheb Phalke Award, India's highest award in cinema.\n- In 2001, Bhupen Hazarika received the Padmabhushan.\n- In 2008, Bhupen Hazarika received the Sangeet Natak Akademi Fellowship, the highest award of the Sangeet Natak Akademi.\n- Sangeet Natak Akademi is the national-level academy for performing arts set up by the Government of India.\n- Sangeet Natak Akademi is The National Academy for Music, Dance and Drama in English.",
